\label{cor: expectation for WUSF on regular tree}
 	For  the toy model $(\mathbb{T}_{b+1},\Gamma_{\xi})$, $\mathbb{E}[|T_x|_{x,\lambda}]<\infty
 	$ if and only if $\lambda\in (0,1)$.

If we decompose $T_x$ according to its intersection with different slabs, we get 
